--- !u!114 &784410451
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 784410446}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7832527eaab32643949085e01dc4d4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - If you're reading this, then you're still alive-and that,at the very least, means
    hope remains for the world of Aethara. I wish I had the time to greet you properly,
    but time is something that none of us have the luxury to waste anyore. You're
    weak, dioriented maybe, but you must stay focused. The war has reached its peak-flames
    from spellfire rain through the skies, and the kingdoms are crumbling under the
    weight of the dark magic users. This, my friend is why you are trapped here.
  - 'The dungeon you''re trapped in is no ordinary dungeon-in fact, it was once a
    living temple, pulsing with the heartbeat of the last living dragon. At the center
    lies the Dragon''s Pulse-a source of ancient magic strong enough to break through
    the curse that plagues our world. Strong enough to rid the world of the dark
    arts for good. If you are able to reach it, you may be able to absorb its power
    and ascend to what this war desperately need: a force of light to counter the
    darkness'
  - This journal will serve as a guide to you. It holds more than just words-it holds
    the knowledge gathered from legend, lore and prophecy in order to inform you
    of the dangers that lie before you. Within this journal, you will find clues,
    warnings, and hidden secrets that will help you progress to the Dragon's Pulse.
    Read carefully, as these writings were meant to be deciphered by the ancient
    ones. They were not intended for the unworthy to interpret. Trust your instincts
    and more importantly, trust the journal. It will reveal the information you need
    when you're ready.
  - FInally, my friend, it is important that you beware the dangers within this ancient
    ruin. The dungeon is segmented into ancient domains, each with its own inhabitants.
    The ruins are known to be home of the Guardian of the Dragon's Pulse. Little
    is known about this creature and legends seem to disagree in its power and form.
    Some stories tell of a being made from words that is sensitive to sound while
    others tell of a spirit of immense light that appears in the darkness. No matter
    what it is or what it looks like, I'm sure you will know what it is when you
    find it...or if it finds you. Regardless, the journal should be able to help
    you will knowing more about it if you study it enough. Just... don't let it catch
    you, or anger it, or distub it in anyway. That is all my friend. Good luck and
    may the gods be with you.
  pageIndex: 0
  leftPage: {fileID: 1695578971}
  rightPage: {fileID: 775452450}
